---
title: SHACL Methodology — Phase Overview
---
timeline
    section Foundations (Once)
        Phase 0 : Governance & Scope
                : Define schema owner, domain stewards
                : Document breaking-change policy
                : Establish ex:inScope annotation
                : Map sh:severity to governance meaning

        Phase 1 : Namespace Strategy
                : Select namespace pattern
                : Define shared sh:prefixes resource
                : Establish IRI naming conventions
                : Sketch owl:imports hierarchy

    section Iterative Cycle (Repeat until exit criteria met)
        Phase 2 : Use Case Development
                : Elicit use cases with domain stewards
                : Sketch Turtle exemplars (2–4 per UC)
                : LLM comparison pass — observations only

        Phase 3 : Taxonomy & Reification
                : Identify SKOS taxonomy candidates
                : Explore reification candidates
                : Sketch sh:reifierShape forms

        Phase 4 : First-Pass Schema
                : LLM-assisted SHACL generation
                : Apply guard-rail checklist
                : Validate against happy-path exemplars

        Phase 5 : Abstract Shapes
                : Identify shared structure candidates
                : Build abstract shapes (no sh:targetClass)
                : Compose via sh:and
                : Extract to owl:imports modules

        Phase 6 : Validation & Testing
                : Build W3C-format test suite
                : Set up CI pipeline
                : Route failures to correct phase

        Phase 7 : Stakeholder Review
                : Generate per-use-case ERDs
                : Governed review — domain stewards
                : Track revisions with annotations
                : Decide: advance or iterate

    section Post-Cycle
        Phase 8 : Transformers & Integration
                : Build source-to-schema mapping matrix
                : Implement SPARQL-Anything / TARQL transformers
                : Validate transformer output against SHACL

        Phase 9 : Ongoing Governance
                : Quarterly review cadence
                : Breaking change management
                : SHACL-on-SHACL revision history
